  "no_colors_cause": "The palette asset /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary is not cooked into the packaged build: DefaultGame.ini has bCookAll=False and only /Game/Data/Effects is in DirectoriesToAlwaysCook, so /Game/Data/Palettes is omitted from the pak. LoadObject in AArenaGameMode::BeginPlay returns null at runtime (log: 'Couldn't find file for package /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary'), the game falls back to gray, and the arena has no colors. Fixed by adding /Game/Data/Palettes to DirectoriesToAlwaysCook in Config/DefaultGame.ini."
}
